    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 4 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## SLO / Error Budget &nbsp;—&nbsp; *are we keeping the promise?*\n\n**SLO:** 99.5% of requests without 5xx **and** 99.5% of requests < 500 ms, over a **30-day** window. &nbsp;·&nbsp; **Error budget** = 0.5% = ~3.6 h/month.\n\n> The *30d* panels (top row) use a fixed 30-day window and **ignore** the time picker. The history and burn-rate charts follow the time range. Latency threshold = `le=\"0.5\"` (SLO bucket boundary — see `application.yml`)."
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Availability SLO — compliance 30d",
      "description": "Percentage of HTTP requests without a server error (5xx) in the last 30 days. Green ≥ 99.5% (SLO).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 4, "w": 6, "h": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(1 - (sum(increase(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=~\"$job\",status=~\"5..\"}[30d])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=~\"$job\"}[30d])), 1))) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "success %",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 3,
          "min": 99,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "#f43f5e", "value": null },
              { "color": "#f59e0b", "value": 99.5 },
              { "color": "#10b981", "value": 99.9 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "graphMode": "none",
        "colorMode": "background_solid",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Error Budget Remaining 30d",
      "description": "How much error budget (0.5%) is left. (compliance - SLO) / (100 - SLO). Red < 20% — hold risky deploys.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 6, "y": 4, "w": 6, "h": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(((1 - (sum(increase(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=~\"$job\",status=~\"5..\"}[30d])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=~\"$job\"}[30d])), 1))) * 100) - $slo) / (100 - $slo) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "budget left",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "#f43f5e", "value": null },
              { "color": "#f59e0b", "value": 20 },
              { "color": "#10b981", "value": 50 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true,
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }
      }
    },

